# Files listed here are excluded from the packed Homey app (`.homeybuild/`).
# NOTE: this file only filters the *source* copy. Anything the TypeScript
# compiler emits into `.homeybuild/` (outDir) is packed regardless — see
# AGENTS.md → "Never ship a secret".

# ── CLI test harness (dev only) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
src/

# ── Dev tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The tuyapi patch is applied to node_modules by `postinstall` at install time,
# so the patch file itself does not need to travel inside the app bundle.
patches/
tsconfig.json
tsconfig.*.json

# ── Python utilities ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py
*.pyc

# ── Build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/

# ── Secrets & local config — NEVER ship ──────────────────────────────────────
devices.json
.env
snapshot.json
tinytuya.json

# ── Docs & private notes (developer-facing only) ─────────────────────────────
# Covers README.md, AGENTS.md, HANDOVER.md and — importantly — the private
# OPENCODE-LOCAL.md. Nothing in these is needed at runtime.
*.md

# ── Dev notes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dp-schema.json
